<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">Bring your own WABA</h3>

<p class="govuk-body">If you already have a registered WhatsApp Business Account (WABA) on Meta, you can wire it to the same multimodal Lambda the simulator calls. The exact API call:</p>

<pre class="govuk-body"><code>aws social-messaging put-whats-app-business-account-event-destinations \
  --waba-id arn:aws:social-messaging:us-east-1:&lt;account&gt;:phone-number-id-&lt;your-waba&gt; \
  --event-destinations '[{
    "EventDestinationLambdaConfiguration": {
      "EventDestinationLambdaArn": "&lt;MultimodalDescribeLambdaArn&gt;"
    }
  }]'</code></pre>

<p class="govuk-body">The Lambda already exercises both code paths, the simulator route AND the WABA payload fixture (<code>schemas/waba-payload-fixture.json</code>), so wiring a real WABA is a one-call change.</p>

<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">IAM policy snippet</h3>

<pre class="govuk-body"><code>{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": { "Service": "social-messaging.amazonaws.com" },
      "Action": "lambda:InvokeFunction",
      "Resource": "&lt;MultimodalDescribeLambdaArn&gt;"
    }
  ]
}</code></pre>

<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">Cleanup, important</h3>

<div class="govuk-warning-text">
  <span class="govuk-warning-text__icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
  <strong class="govuk-warning-text__text">
    <span class="govuk-visually-hidden">Important</span>
    The +44 800 phone number is retained on stack delete. You MUST run <code>isb close-account</code> after, not just <code>isb terminate</code>, otherwise the pool account's 30-day Connect cap will block the next lease user.
  </strong>
</div>

<ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number govuk-list--spaced">
  <li>Check no active Connect contacts: <code>aws connect get-current-metric-data --instance-id &lt;id&gt; --filters Channels=VOICE --groupings ROUTING_PROFILE --current-metrics Name=CONTACTS_IN_QUEUE,Unit=COUNT</code></li>
  <li>Delete the stack: <code>aws cloudformation delete-stack --stack-name ndx-try-ai-contact-centre-... --profile NDX/SandboxAdmin --region us-east-1</code></li>
  <li>Wait for <code>DELETE_COMPLETE</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Run <code>isb close-account &lt;account-id&gt;</code></strong>, the phone number is only released on pool account closure.</li>
  <li>Note: any share-PDF presigned URLs you generated remain valid for up to 24 hours. Do not share them publicly.</li>
</ol>
